"},\"ref\":\"d111\",\"snippet\":\" ... 1931, 1940 \\n:Harcourt Johnstone: 1931, 1940 \\n:Cuthbert Headlam: 1931, 1940 \\n:Gwilym Lloyd George: 1929, 1951\\n:Walter Ayles: 1929, 1945\\n:Somerville Hastings\",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Records_of_members_of_parliament_of_the_United_Kingdom\"},{\"navigation_seen\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d110\"},\"ref\":\"d110\",\"snippet\":\" ... 1779\\n\\nKingston Hall (Kingston Lacy), Dorset | Henry Bankes the Younger | alterations | unexecuted (no drawings)\\n\\n1780\\n\\nAllanbank, Berwicks | John Stuart, l\",\"title\":\"https://www.soane.org/collections/research-library/chronological-list-sir-john-soanes-buildings\"},{\"navigation_seen\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d109\"},\"ref\":\"d109\",\"snippet\":\" ... 1983; 2008 edition – pictured – University of California Press, 374 pages)\\n\\nLiza Dalby, also known as Liza Crihfield Dalby, is an American anthropologist. \",\"title\":\"https://sevencircumstances.com/2022/05/21/real-and-fictional-geishas-and-what-to-read/\"}],\"consecutive_repeat_rounds\":0,\"contract\":{\"enabled\":true,\"gap_state\":true,\"guided_read\":true,\"recovery_rounds\":2,\"repeat_threshold\":2,\"repetition\":\"bounded\",\"reuse_results\":true,\"version\":\"gap-workflow-v1\"},\"instruction\":\"Use the current missing relation to choose a real next action. Page-name search is not page reading; cached is not proof of progress.\",\"last_new_navigation_source_round\":15,\"last_new_raw_source_round\":15,\"previous_gap_judgments_not_verified\":[],\"recovery_decisions_used\":0,\"stage\":\"normal\"},\"retriever_capabilities\":{\"boolean_operators\":false,\"kind\":\"sqlite-fts5-bm25\",\"negative_result\":\"no hit for this expression is not proof that the fact is absent\",\"phrase_quotes\":false,\"query_rule\":\"lowercase; regex word extraction; first-occurrence deduplication; OR of quoted individual tokens\",\"ranking\":\"SQLite bm25(sear